  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-wibble-wobble-ride-v4.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "d96ec5726c51d4f580a83b62f40d4f3c1271cd8cfdc83cc638c40df5f8dbd91c",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5512530c6ee1e4b65ceab44e6945aa95facbd1552bcad3fe18f072ca6a3384e7",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nWibble-Wobble\nRide",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2cf8ed55ba8171c0ff678dc2bb857df9fc8fbba9203abd3833ac1bd93ff64b60",
      "text": "“Look at them go!”\nWukong’s tail went BOING!\n“I want to ride, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9ef7f4a94db1079d3265bcf276e717ccc07b324d8ed24732a4ac9a960485eb49",
      "text": "Wukong put on his helmet.\n“Ready!”\n“Um… it’s backward!”\nWukong giggled.\n“Let’s try again!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d537604706869849c8c407939ad8c2601c541c5187964974d40542f62df2f5e2",
      "text": "He pushed with his feet.\nScoot. Scoot. Scoot.\n“Look! A monkey scooter!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "01884b0facbea4399a583e285dfc72a2477939955025e32e4cff15d427759b98",
      "text": "Feet up…\nWibble! Wobble!\nPLOP!\n“Hello, grass.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "26b5772acfe981ae66e3c966cc42a83d111af8ec112da7000715c747b7a2b0ab",
      "text": "“Maybe the bell will help.”\nDing! Ding!\nThe bell worked.\nThe wobble stayed.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ee05f62783bdeee0eafafa4d3c7c9c0ec7367a1a48331dc8a5aa27b8ce378133",
      "text": "Pigsy held the seat.\n“Eyes ahead. Nice and slow.”\nRabbit cheered.\n“You can do it!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "828c3550c276eb1dc18b6e9ba610d9ce24c2cd7a45c058d619f3eca5c66bce60",
      "text": "Wukong tried again.\nOne push.\nOne pedal.\nTwo.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "83bd9a152af0d8936864177dfe39cb1a8f4d31a547e5408186737dd756aecece",
      "text": "He wobbled left.\nHis tail wobbled right.\n“My tail is learning, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a378780d265d4c364e4ec5d7197b132a7bbaba8cb97980e4027a5023677f8891",
      "text": "He tried a little every day.\nSome rides were short.\nSome were wobbly.\nHe kept trying.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "aa390e5d6a1195a76aac89509ba86ea316f204d54b85880a5e723afe7a6534bd",
      "text": "Then, one evening…\nPigsy let go.\nWukong kept going!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b0695ceb5efb392a1396a881bbfc006e4888f51fcfa546d858d64a0237545485",
      "text": "“I’m doing it!”\nHis scarf fluttered.\nHis tail made a loop.\nEven his ears felt proud.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c58256b205286d026982708ad3d284cc530f93c4b499ec192b8a077762eb5971",
      "text": "He learned to turn.\nHe learned to stop.\nJust before a puddle.\n“After you, little duck.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7902cc092ca4459b2527d797e527ccc70594156813305937cf2703842de6ea2f",
      "text": "Now they rode together.\nNo rush.\nJust happy wheels.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "82e31bac5123a5268cee014084964028d05eaa6ca56cd43db81aafe716433416",
      "text": "At home, he parked his bike.\n“Goodnight, wheels.”\n“Goodnight, wobbles.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6b29f9e99f9bc9955e78657e307264deac62cb3c026c0198680129db9e288e4d",
      "text": "Wukong curled up in bed.\nIn his dreams,\nthe path was smooth.\nAnd the wheels whispered,\n“Shhh…”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
